  <item nodeId="node-97">
    <command xml:space="preserve">n</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You enter into the stairwell. You take a deep, ragged breath. Your body has already begun to ache in anticipation of your going down the stairs.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;    *** You go down the stairs. On to another adventure. Another mystery. ***&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;Would you like to RESTART, RESTORE a saved game, QUIT or UNDO the last command?&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
  </item>
