  <item nodeId="node-393">
    <command xml:space="preserve">n</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">(first unlocking the rickety door with the old key, then opening the door)&#x000A;You enter into the stairwell. You take a deep, ragged breath. Your body has already begun to ache in anticipation of your going down the stairs.&#x000A;&#x000A;Stairwell&#x000A;The stairwell is musty, hot, and humid. You already feel your asthma acting up.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;    *** You go down the stairs. On to another adventure. Another mystery. ***&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;Would you like to RESTART, RESTORE a saved game, QUIT or UNDO the last command?&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-394"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-394">
    <command xml:space="preserve">restart</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">lesson2_office&#x000A;An Interactive Fiction by nico ailani carlson&#x000A;Release 1 / Serial number 250911 / Inform 7 v10.1.2 / D&#x000A;&#x000A;Investigator's Office&#x000A;A picturesque PI's office. Venetian blinds, a dense cloud of cigar smoke settled at eye level, and a desk that is littered with litter with a chair standing beside. On the desk is not two, not three, but one opened bottle of whiskey and a single apple. &#x000A;&#x000A; Along the one windowless wall stands a bookshelf with a portrait beside it. &#x000A;&#x000A; To the north is the only door, it leads out to the hallway.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-395"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-395">
    <command xml:space="preserve">n</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Hallway&#x000A;A drab hallway. The paint is peeling from the walls and the floor creaks beneath your feet. To the east the elevator doors are open, waiting for you to enter as if by fate. To the north is the stairwell, enemy of your weak calves and smoke drenched lungs.&#x000A;&#x000A;A fly buzzes around your face. You swat at it.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-396"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-396">
    <command xml:space="preserve">n</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">(first attempting to unlock the door, but you have nothing to unlock it with)&#x000A;The door is locked and you do not have the means to open it.&#x000A;&#x000A;A fly flies past your ear. You swat at it!&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-397"/>
    </children>
  </item>
